// Title: UAC Bypass Using NTFS Reparse Point - Process
// Rule ID: 39ed3c80-e6a1-431b-9df3-911ac53d08a7
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_uac_bypass_ntfs_reparse_point.yml
